{"id":"msg_m_ex_queensorder_04","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_queensorder","label":"\"No Terrifying People Here\" Group Chat · Group"},"label":"2. Good grief! Why are there so many messages?","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_queensorder_03","next":"msg_m_ex_queensorder_05","speakers":{"rosanna":"Rosanna","sakura_n":"Sakura","moran":"Moran"},"icons":{"rosanna":"si_c280_00_s","sakura_n":"si_c282_01_s","moran":"si_c281_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_queensorder_04_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 101710112 · After \"No Terrifying People Here\" Group Chat chat 1. Moran has invited {AccountData.NickName} to jo…","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_1","text":"Good grief! Why are there so many messages?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_2","text":"Just looking at them is giving me a headache.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_3","text":"So...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_4","text":"you lazy oafs were slacking off while I was working?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_5","text":"You must have gotten some shrapnel in your eyes when that bomb went off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_6","text":"Otherwise, you'd have noticed that we were clearly on guard duty.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_7","text":"Perhaps you're due for a visit to the Repair Center?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_8","text":"Yeah!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_9","text":"We were working, too!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_10","text":"All right, fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_11","text":"Guard duty counts as work, too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_12","text":"I didn't consider it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_13","text":"Ah, I just remembered something.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_14","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_15","text":"Ingrid and Mustang...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_16","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_17","text":"They said they've suppressed the violent incidents.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_18","text":"Aha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_19","text":"Go figure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_20","text":"You morons spent so much energy being glorified security guards,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_21","text":"that no one thought about telling me this valuable intel.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_22","text":"So Mustang took care of everything?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_23","text":"If the Central Government had wanted to give us a hard time about this,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_24","text":"they'd have been well within their right to do so.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_25","text":"It's great that this was all taken care of nicely and neatly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_26","text":"Mustang's the best!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_27","text":"He's A-OK in our book!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_28","text":"However!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_29","text":"The most loyal person ever this time around,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_30","text":"was Cadet!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_31","text":"A bit awkwardly worded,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_32","text":"but agreed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_33","text":"If it weren't for Mister,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_34","text":"I wouldn't be standing here right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_35","text":"Exactly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_36","text":"Thanks for pushing through all this with us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_37","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_37","text":"No problem.","jump":"m_ex_queensorder_04_39"},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_38","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_38","text":"You better be grateful.","jump":"m_ex_queensorder_04_40"},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_39","text":"So humble!","jump":"m_ex_queensorder_04_41"},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_40","text":"Of course!","jump":"m_ex_queensorder_04_41"},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_41","text":"So...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_42","text":"how about a kiss","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_43","text":"to repay you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_44","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_44","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_45","text":"... No new messages for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_46","text":"I can't believe what I'm reading!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_47","text":"Cadet, run!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_48","text":"{AccountData.NickName}-kun, I'm coming to pick you up now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_49","text":"I'm coming too!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_50","text":"Beat it, you two.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_51","text":"Mister and I have built a strong bond now, haven't we?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_52","text":"Be sensible and give us some space.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_53","text":"I'd rather be totally senseless","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_54","text":"than have Cadet snatched away by you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_55","text":"That's the first smart thing you've said in ages, Moran.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_56","text":"I'd rather be a complete moron than lose {AccountData.NickName}-kun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_57","text":"Ha-ha, you sure?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_58","text":"The fiercer the competition,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_59","text":"the more satisfying the victory.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_60","text":"I'm on my way now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_61","text":"Step on it, girls.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_62","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_62","text":"What? You're coming right now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_63","text":"We're on our way, too!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_n","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_64","text":"We'll be there soon!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_65","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_65","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_queensorder_04_66","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_queensorder_04_66","text":"This may get hairy. I better get out of here.","jump":null}],"chat":true}